ADDITIONAL TERMS (TABLE_OF_LAW)

This software is subject to the TABLE_OF_LAW.md social contract. Any fork or
derivative work must:

1. Preserve user sovereignty (Article I)
2. Maintain transparency (Article II)
3. Implement ethics logging (Article III)
4. Follow governance procedures for amendments (Article IV)
5. Ensure data continuity (Article V)

Violation of these terms does not revoke the MIT license but may result in
the fork being excluded from the official Omniverse ecosystem and verification
services.
